            {
               "text": "<div class=\"atlasCircleContainer1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 160\" class=\"circle-draw\" id=\"svgcirctri1\">  <defs> <marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"3\" markerHeight=\"3\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"> <path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" /></marker> </defs> <path d=\"M 348 150 A 148 148 0 0 0 200 2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#71a6d2\" stroke-width=\"3\"/> <path class=\"radius-30\" d=\"M 230 130 A 30 30 0 0 1 240.0 150.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#71a6d2\" stroke-width=\"3\"/> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" style=\"stroke: black;\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" /> <line class=\"radius-line\" x1=\"200\" y1=\"149\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"149\"></line> <line class=\"radius-line\" x1=\"319\" y1=\"149\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"67\"></line> <line class=\"radius-line\" x1=\"200\" y1=\"149\" x2=\"319\" y2=\"67\"></line> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"250\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">c</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"180\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">O</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"325\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">Q</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"380\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">x</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"325\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">P</text>  <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"260\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">a</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"223\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"1.0em\" font-weight=\"bold\">θ</text> </svg></div></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Gráfico 2</b>: El ángulo theta (θ) entre el radio y el eje x; la proyección del radio es el segmento OQ (cateto a).</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
